Description: Abseil random_internal_distribution_caller library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: 20260817
Requires: absl_config = 20260817, absl_utility = 20260817, absl_fast_type_id = 20260817, absl_type_traits = 20260817, absl_random_mocking_access = 20260817
Libs: -L${libdir}  
Cflags: -I${includedir} -DNOMINMAX
